                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans are driving up health care costs. Have you window shopped for insurance and seen an OUTRAGEOUSLY HIGH insurance premium? I want to hear how this affects your family. Share your premium increases with me so I can keep fighting to lower your costs. https://t.co/c3Hunnp3v2",
