                "quoted_status_profile_username": "CBSNews",
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In Trump's America, hungry kids don't get fed, your insurance premium jumps by a thousand dollars, and you can't even fly home for Thanksgiving. Is this what Trump\u2019s \u201cwinning\u201d looks like?",
