                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Unaffordable health insurance, groceries, and rent\u2014that\u2019s the Republican agenda. I can\u2019t think of anything more cruel. https://t.co/gpxBnJVl7J",
