                "quoted_status_profile_username": "washingtonpost",
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans will let you go hungry or bleed out on the pavement with their halting of SNAP and price hikes to your health insurance\u2014and with their shutdown, they\u2019ll let you freeze, too. \n\nThey\u2019re playing politics with Americans\u2019 lives.",
