                "favorite_count": 6,
                "geo_lat": null,
                "geo_lon": null,
                "id": "1987278155703582724",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": null,
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "quote",
                "quote_count": 0,
                "quoted_status_id": "1986601008714424812",
                "quoted_status_profile_id": "16635277",
                "quoted_status_profile_username": "Acyn",
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "My constituents have told me they\u2019re going to **stop seeing a doctor if they\u2019re sick** because their insurance premiums jumped by thousands of dollars and groceries are only getting more expensive because of tariffs. \n\u00a0\nThey\u2019re making impossible choices because Trump doesn\u2019t \u201cwant to hear about the affordability.\u201d",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762639008,
                "view_count": 1088
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": [
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5Zp7c9WEAAg24Z.jpg?name=small"
                ],
                "attached_medias_url": [
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5Zp7c9WEAAg24Z.jpg"
                ],
                "attached_videos": null,
                "author_id": "31801993",
                "author_username": "FrankPallone",
                "community_notes": null,
                "conversation_id": "1987892759512965547",
                "created_time": "2025-11-10T14:39:01",
                "favorite_count": 6,
                "geo_lat": null,
                "geo_lon": null,
                "id": "1987892759512965547",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": null,
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "post",
                "quote_count": 0,
                "quoted_status_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We\u2019re more than a week into open enrollment and about a month and a half into the Republican shutdown\u2014and constituents are telling me that their new health insurance premiums are going to BURY them.\n\nHave you received your new Get Covered New Jersey premium and seen a RIDICULOUS premium increase? Fill out the survey in my bio.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762785541,
                "view_count": 952
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": null,
                "attached_medias_url": null,
                "attached_videos": null,
                "author_id": "31801993",
                "author_username": "FrankPallone",
                "community_notes": null,
                "conversation_id": "1988779605281391053",
                "created_time": "2025-11-13T01:23:02",
                "favorite_count": 17,
                "geo_lat": null,
                "geo_lon": null,
                "id": "1988779605281391053",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": null,
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "post",
                "quote_count": 1,
                "quoted_status_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I voted NO to cutting your health care. I voted NO to sending your neighbors into bankruptcy because they can't pay for their health insurance. I voted NO to making your relatives sicker. Republicans simply could not care less.\n\u00a0\nI promise you, I'm going to fight every day in Congress to get your health care back and fight for what Republicans won't: lower costs, healthier families, and a more prosperous America.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762996982,
                "view_count": 1082
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": [
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5ptohPXUAEMwnR.jpg?name=small"
                ],
                "attached_medias_url": [
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5ptohPXUAEMwnR.jpg"
                ],
                "attached_videos": null,
                "author_id": "31801993",
                "author_username": "FrankPallone",
                "community_notes": null,
                "conversation_id": "1989022731656987076",
                "created_time": "2025-11-13T17:29:08",
                "favorite_count": 7,
                "geo_lat": null,
                "geo_lon": null,
                "id": "1989022731656987076",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": null,
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "post",
                "quote_count": 0,
                "quoted_status_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "More than HALF your take-home pay. Imagine if that was what your insurance premium jumped to. Are you just supposed to hope and pray you never get sick?\n\nThat\u2019s what Republicans forced millions of Americans like this constituent to do. This is the kind of cruelty I voted against. https://t.co/I8zMYp1bbJ",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1763054948,
                "view_count": 531
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": [
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G6NiNApXsAAsuSG.jpg?name=small",
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G6NiNAmXsAInYQq.jpg?name=small"
