                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Democrats made Rx prices more affordable for seniors on Medicare in 2022, but there\u2019s more we can do to provide relief at the pharmacy counter.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nThat\u2019s why I introduced the Lowering Drug Costs for American Families Act today. It\u2019s time we expand these lower prices and out-of-pocket caps to everyone with private health insurance.",
